  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Practical Desktop Launcher",
    "overview": "Qwenox is a familiar Windows utility: a white workspace, a cool grey profile rail, readable dark labels and restrained blue controls. Compact Segoe UI typography supports repeated operational use. Visual emphasis comes from state, selection and measured values rather than decoration.\n\nThis system applies only to the embedded launcher in src/launcher_static. It does not establish the design of the separate inference API dashboard. The user has confirmed a professional launcher with no anime imagery or decorative wallpaper; the implementation is code-led and ships no ornamental raster assets.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Light working surfaces with a cool profile rail.",
      "Blue actions and selection; semantic colours for service state.",
      "Compact Windows typography with tabular numerical measurements.",
      "Flat workspace panels, with elevation reserved for transient feedback.",
      "Clear separation between a selected profile and the running service."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Action and State Rule",
